WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.150
Filtration separates an undissolved solid from a liquid.

2
00:00:04.877 --> 00:00:09.527
Sand and salt water. The filter's holes are smaller than a sand grain.

3
00:00:15.106 --> 00:00:19.956
The sand stays behind as residue; water and dissolved salt pass through.

4
00:00:20.982 --> 00:00:23.682
To get the salt back, evaporate the water.
